<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PictureTel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PictureTel cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded PictureTel Corp to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept PictureTel's long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- PictureTel lost 13/16 to 13 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
